1527 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Yandex Cloud                                                                                    2025 \205 Present\nData Engineer\nAchievements to date\072\nSet up multi\055stage data delivery pipelines to the DWH for 8\053 domains\054 processing terabyte\055scale data in alignment with business requirements and system constraints\073\nExecuted a large\055scale migration of a core CDM \050100\053 dependent processes\051 to improve system performance and optimize data workflows\073\nCore responsibilities\072\nDesigning and maintaining Data Quality monitoring and validation systems\054 improving data accuracy and reliability across data pipelines\073\nContinuously work on resource utilization optimization by decommissioning outdated processes and improving performance of existing workflows\073\nEnd\055to\055end incident management and solution performance monitoring\054 including detection\054 logging\054 root cause analysis\054 and resolution\073\nExtra Duties\072\nCollaboration with engineering teams to track and resolve technical issues\073\nAccess management and PR reviews\054 ensuring security\054 code quality\054 and compliance\056\n\nLatoken \050top\05530 crypto exchange\051                                                 2023 \205 2025\nData Solutions Engineer\nAchievements \057 Responsibilities\072\nDesigned and implemented an ML\055based tool\054 leveraging blockchain activity and trending metrics to discover new tokens with high potential of becoming popular\054 streamlining the listing process\056 Tokens listed based on the model\047s recommendations achieved a 450\045 growth\073\nDeveloped and maintained data ingestion pipelines\054 including API integrations with blockchain data providers to collect on\055chain data for 17k\053 tokens across 30\053 networks\056 Combined it with off\055chain data and integrated it into data warehouse\054 achieving over 3x token data coverage\073\nRedesigned the DWH architecture in collaboration with 5 cross\055functional teams to support new tokens addition logic\054 improving scalability and reducing query processing times\073\nMaintained and optimized Airflow ETL pipelines\054 ensuring seamless daily ingestion of 1TB\053 data from production databases into the analytical DWH\073\nCalculated detailed trade\055based Trading Desk PnL using 3TB\053 of trades data using partitioned computing\054 enhancing trading strategy insights and reducing potential risks\073\nCreated 10\053 automated Power BI dashboards \050e\056g\056\054 Exchange Rating fluctuations monitoring panel\054 Collected Fees reconciliation\051 providing actionable insights for key stakeholders\073\nReported directly to the CEO and represented the Data Unit in cross\055functional discussions and company\055wide initiatives\056\n\nCloudReports \050analytical platform\051                                               2021 \205 2023\nBackend Developer\nAchievements \057 Responsibilities\072\nDeveloped ETL\057ELT connectors for 15\053 cloud services \050ERP\054 CRM\054 Marketplaces\051 and analytical DWH \050BigQuery\054 ClickHouse\051\nCreated SQL views for system entities to prepare data for user analytics integration\nSingle\055handedly supported 420\053 working integrations\nDeveloped a Python package that accelerated the release of new integrations by 300\045\nOptimized data export logic\054 achieving more than 5x Google Cloud resources cost reduction\nEngaged with clients and data providers to analyze requirements and design optimal data delivery and integration solutions\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1528 0 R
     /Pg 1509 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

